    Bug 1998102 - Add hkps://mail-api.proton.me to the default key server list. r=kaie


    Add the Proton key server
    Remove the old WKD workaround for Proton as they now have WKD, and for hosted domains the workaround would break.
    Add a context menu to get the URL where the key was found (for people who want to check for themselves).

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304043

